<!-- 5.0 — THE notification (expanded): steps and water as two progress rings in one bar.
       header   today's date · status pill · live clock · pause/resume
       rings    steps (green → gold at the goal) | water (blue → green): ring with %, number, goal, what's left
       stats    km · kcal · walking time · km/h (or kcal eaten, when the food log is used today)
       water    glass · cup · can · bottle (tap to add) · Undo · Edit
       footer   the motto · the day ends in …
     About 222dp — under the ~252dp Android 12+ gives a custom expanded notification. Clocks and
     timers are ticked by the system. Only views and setters RemoteViews allows; the rings are
     ProgressBars with a level-driven ring drawable. Filled by StepNotifier.fillLive(); the chip
     ids are shared with notif_water.xml (WaterReminder.fillChips). -->
<LinearLayout xmlns:android="http://schemas.android.com/apk/res/android"
    android:layout_width="match_parent" android:layout_height="wrap_content" android:background="@drawable/notif_live_card" android:paddingStart="12dp" android:paddingTop="8dp" android:paddingEnd="12dp" android:paddingBottom="8dp"
    android:orientation="vertical">
<LinearLayout android:layout_width="match_parent" android:layout_height="22dp" android:gravity="center_vertical" android:orientation="horizontal">
